  "description": "Crawls INSDC (International Nucleotide Sequence Database Collaboration) records from ENA — enumerates every run, experiment, sample, and study connected to a project accession and persists them via the BioFSharp.INSDC.SQLite store.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
